1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Fake internship?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Easy money, but an upfront registration fee? Watch out. That's a scam warning sign.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Then a caller posing as a police officer threatens a so-called digital arrest and demands your personal details.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Never share OTPs, passwords or bank details. Verify callers through official channels.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Report at cybercrime.gov.in. For financial fraud, call 1930.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Pause. Verify.
